其六","author":"吴芾","text":"出仕曾尘侍从班，退休还得老湖山。\n已惭过分无他望，只愿吾儿相对閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43484,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送津赴绍兴倅八首 其五","author":"吴芾","text":"我曾开凿鉴湖田，功竟难成愧昔贤。\n汝谒马祠须问讯，此湖兴复是何年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43485,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送津赴绍兴倅八首 其四","author":"吴芾","text":"当年我镇卧龙山，曾种千花与万竿。\n岁久不知无恙否，因来且为报平安。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43486,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送津赴绍兴倅八首 其三","author":"吴芾","text":"汝辞秦邸佐名藩，端为亲庭数舍间。\n数舍相望虽不远，争如在侧日承颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43487,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送津赴绍兴倅八首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"山色湖光足自怡，幽栖无一不相宜。\n只嫌野外游从少，汝早归来共乐之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43488,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送津赴绍兴倅八首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"读书已负少年时，老大空疏愧我知。\n汝肯为余偿此志，虽穷亦是起家儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43489,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送朝宗兼简闽帅","author":"吴芾","text":"年来知我不如公，日日相思恨不逢。\n君若见时须问我，为言老子已龙钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43490,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"香丛","author":"吴芾","text":"缓步绕芳丛，时时鼻观通。\n不须薰百和，满院是香风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43491,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"倚楼","author":"吴芾","text":"独倚危楼一望长，恼人情处是斜阳。\n神州更在斜阳外，纵使无情也断肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43492,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏日游灵隐东园赠东方道人","author":"吴芾","text":"松竹回环十里阴，一声啼鸟觉山深。\n道人睡足北窗下，一榻清风直万金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43493,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"捉月台","author":"吴芾","text":"谪仙捉月古今传，我访遗踪似未然。\n山下浊流长混混，夜深安得水中天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43494,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桂堂","author":"吴芾","text":"长恨年年月窟秋，无人共拍酒船浮。\n君家双桂开时节，我欲从君载酒游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43495,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桃花菊 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"名园看尽好花枝，黄菊施朱独未窥。\n应是天怜秋寂寞，故分春色到东篱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43496,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桃花菊 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"秋来不谓见春华，疑与春风是一家。\n已向枝头开菊蕊，更来菊上作桃花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43497,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留长河堰","author":"吴芾","text":"湖山堂下水声寒，夜半琮琤响佩环。\n梦寐欲归归未得，却来此处听潺潺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43498,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"真止堂","author":"吴芾","text":"我有虚堂号真止，坐来万虑清如水。\n君今更以止名堂，想见了无尘念起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43499,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读刘与权壮士歌","author":"吴芾","text":"满眼烟尘未息戈，禦戎无策奈愁何。\n一尊浊酒空庭晚，独自歌君壮士歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43500,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酒酣再赋一绝","author":"吴芾","text":"二年两度到蛾眉，今日还来话别离。\n所恨行人难久住，酒阑不见月明时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43501,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钱丈处和和所寄韩子云约赏梅绝句复用前韵谢之三首 其三","author":"吴芾","text":"竹符驱我出山来，万事无心付酒杯。\n又见江城春到也，伤情却忆故园梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43502,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钱丈处和和所寄韩子云约赏梅绝句复用前韵谢之三首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"曲生为我惠然来，陡觉春浮潋滟杯。\n饮罢冥搜无好语，但将风味属江梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43503,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钱丈处和和所寄韩子云约赏梅绝句复用前韵谢之三首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"锦囊新句忽传来，字字清如竹叶杯。\n要须莫放传杯手，看即归调傅说梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43504,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钱广文采芹亭","author":"吴芾","text":"开明后学日升车，千里文风一旦雄。\n池上采芹摇水碧，帐中摛藻映纱红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43505,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陪梁大谏陈察院同登蒋山","author":"吴芾","text":"尽室斋心谒梵宫，愿求一语卜穷通。\n老夫祇欲归田去，懒把前程问志公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43506,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄龚帅 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"虽喜英贤帅十连，却惭糠秕滥居前。\n自知未免人扬簸，愿使衰翁晚节全。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43507,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄龚帅 其三","author":"吴芾","text":"行李看看近故庐，梦魂犹自绕洪都。\n帅垣暇日登临处，把酒还能话我无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43508,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄龚帅 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"今朝駃步忽来前，报道除书下日边。\n阃寄复归贤使者，百城闻命想欣然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43509,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄龚漕六首 其六","author":"吴芾","text":"闻公新有帅垣除，一路逢人尽贺予。\n瓜代得贤人尚喜，予心欢喜更何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43510,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄龚漕六首 其五","author":"吴芾","text":"天朝未许投簪去，我幸已成全璧归。\n全璧归来何所憾，暮年只是惜分违。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43511,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄龚漕六首 其四","author":"吴芾","text":"葺得南园过一春，无从再见物华新。\n匆匆相别休相忆，已有风流贤主人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43512,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄龚漕六首 其三","author":"吴芾","text":"贡院门前并北湖，有田百亩却荒芜。\n愿君种取花千树，付与邦人作画图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43513,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄龚漕六首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"几年湮塞豫章沟，岁岁民间有水忧。\n我意若非公善后，不应城里解通舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43514,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄龚漕六首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"自古知心不易逢，君心还与我心同。\n纵令自择交成契，更有何人得似公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43515,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄朝宗二首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"湖水春来拍岸平，山光幻出小蓬瀛。\n幽深未许凡人到，只待君来共落成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43516,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄韩子云二首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"点检枝头春已来，不应辜负掌中杯。\n与君索笑须宜早，莫待城头吹落梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43517,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄韩子云二首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"去岁花时许我来，花前竟阻共衔杯。\n如今又是花开也，忍使衰翁独看梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43518,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄韩子云总领","author":"吴芾","text":"与君有约看梅花，准拟尊前共笑歌。\n花已飘零君不至，夕阳芳草奈愁何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43519,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题隐静三首 其三","author":"吴芾","text":"我师一出几何年，闻欲东归未有缘。\n何日扶藜能过我，湖山深处共谈禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43520,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题隐静三首 其二","author":"吴芾","text":"向来连岁守江城，到处题诗满户庭。\n独欠兹山一转语，倩师与我谢山灵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43521,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题隐静三首 其一","author":"吴芾","text":"五峰双涧旧标名，我恨当年去不成。\n却羡个中人自在，饱看山色听泉声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":43522,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]